{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026LMLIHRlhlh1793089344.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太區主要股市向好。</p><p></p><p>日本股市終止三連跌，回升逾一千點，重回63,000點水平。科技股回暖，東京電子升百分之3，軟銀升近半成。</p><p></p><p>韓國股市反彈，升約半成，兩大權重股三星電子和SK海力士，升約百分之4至5。</p><p></p><p>台灣股市復市後反彈，收市升逾百分之1。</p><p></p><p>澳洲股市連升第三日。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T09:22:14.840043+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T08:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T10:58:18.665627+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:18:26.751172+00:00","content_hash":"cfde283c42d0a2ffc9805984ab20849e1a8f9373904333e8a3248945dfd2b6bc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T09:22:14.840043+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}